HKEX', 'CRYPTO')\", \"enum\": [\"NYSE\", \"NASDAQ\", \"LSE\", \"HKEX\", \"CRYPTO\"]}}, \"required\": [\"exchange\"]}}, {\"name\": \"place_sell_order\", \"description\": \"Place a sell order.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"ticker\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Asset symbol\", \"enum\": [\"AAPL\", \"GOOGL\", \"TSLA\", \"MSFT\", \"AMZN\"]}, \"quantity\": {\"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"Amount to sell\", \"default\": 1.0}}, \"required\": [\"ticker\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nCan you check the current time in America/New_York and let me know whether NASDAQ is open? Then please look up the contact details for alice and prepare a high-priority in-app alert to her with the message: “Your booking is confirmed.” After that, sell 2 shares of AAPL.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
